@media(max-width:900px){main{padding:14px}.top{display:block}.actions{justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:14px}.capture-banner{grid-template-columns:1fr}.capture-actions,.capture-meta{justify-content:flex-start}.toolbar{grid-template-columns:1fr}.summary{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.stat.wide{grid-column:1/-1}.health{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.export-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}th:nth-child(5),td:nth-child(5),th:nth-child(6),td:nth-child(6){display:none}}
@media(max-width:560px){.summary,.health,.export-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.button{width:100%;justify-content:center}.tool form{display:block}.tool input,.tool select,.tool .button{width:100%;margin-top:8px}th:nth-child(4),td:nth-child(4){display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<section class="top">
<div class="brand"><div class="mark">SW</div><div><h1>SiteWatch</h1><div class="subtitle">Мониторинг блокировок по устройствам без постоянного DNS-логирования</div></div></div>
<div class="actions">
<button class="button" id="themeToggle" type="button">Dark</button>
</div>
</section>

<section class="capture-banner ${capture_state:-idle}" id="captureBanner" data-state="$capture_state" data-start="$capture_time" data-duration="$capture_duration" data-remaining="$capture_remaining">
<div class="capture-left"><span class="pulse"></span><div><b id="captureTitle">$capture_text</b><div class="muted" id="captureDetail">Новые DNS-запросы подхватываются автоматически во время активного окна.</div></div></div>
<div>
<div class="capture-meta"><span class="timer" id="captureTimer">${capture_remaining:-}</span> <span class="live-tag" id="captureMode">${capture_state:-idle}</span></div>
<div class="capture-actions">
<a class="button warn" href="?action=capture&duration=45$source_q">45 сек</a>
<a class="button warn" href="?action=capture_live$source_q">Live</a>
<a class="button danger" href="?action=capture_stop$source_q">Стоп</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="toolbar">
<div class="tool">
<div class="tool-title">Проверка устройства</div>
